alse,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122782","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122782","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122782.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122782.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-27T17:33:12Z"},"body":"Dear Godot Community,\r\n\r\nWe contributed visionOS support in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109975.\r\n\r\nThis follow-up implements several additional visionOS 26 features through the Compositor Services API:\r\n- Progressive immersion style. This needed wrapping `cp_drawable_encode_present()` in an empty draw pass, in order to draw the immersive portal. There'd be a more efficient way of doing if we could intercept the last submitted command buffer of the engine, but it was left out of scope of this PR.\r\n- Dynamic immersion style switching. Needed changing Apple embedded platforms `UIApplicationSupportsMultipleScenes` `false` -> `true`.\r\n- Dynamic render quality, with corresponding `xr/visionos` project settings.\r\n- Dynamic upper hand and system overlays visibility toggling, with initial values from the new `xr/visionos` project settings.\r\n- Emit the Swift to ObjC interop header from the SCons Swift builder (to support dynamic C++ -> Swift property propagation).\r\n\r\ncc @BastiaanOlij @stuartcarnie ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"